{'symbol': 'HD', 'date': '2023-03-02 08:00:00', 'title': 'THE HOME DEPOT LAUNCHES VIRTUAL KIDS WORKSHOPS ON ROBLOX', 'text': "ATLANTA , MARCH 2, 2023\xa0 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY, THE HOME DEPOT® LAUNCHED A NEW VIRTUAL KIDS WORKSHOP, AN EXPERIENCE IN ROBLOX'S REDCLIFF CITY THAT CHALLENGES GAMERS TO PLAY AND LEARN BY COLLECTING MATERIALS TO BUILD PROJECTS. THE HOME DEPOT'S DEBUT INTO THE METAVERSE MARKS ITS LATEST INVESTMENT IN THE FUTURE OF INTERCONNECTED EXPERIENCES – ALL WHILE INTRODUCING A WHOLE NEW GENERATION OF DOERS TO HOME IMPROVEMENT AND THE JOY OF BUILDING."}